			"Message": "chore(Worker): Update commit-msg.json to reflect the latest commit\n\nAdvance the stored message in commit-msg.json from the previous\ndocumentation update (a464e68) to the most recent commit (556f770).\n\nThis keeps the machine-readable commit tracking file in sync after\neach commit, ensuring downstream tooling and audit pipelines always\nreference the current commit message without parsing git log.",
